 "_": "Altman series, episode 1 («Гарааны бизнес эхлүүлэх хамгийн сайн үе»), from Y Combinator's 'Sam Altman: Never a Better Time to Do a Startup' (Startup School 2026, youtube ZIaOBAjvc38). Edit this file, then npm run build:altman-ep1. 'from' is seconds in the original video. A beat lasts lead + pre + voice + post (or 'hold'); its cuts share that time in proportion to 'len', so keep each share inside its camera shot (shots are listed in docs/altman-series/ep1-storyboard.md). Cuts are framed by x, zoom and cy as in the Jensen reel. part/next drive the episode badge and the end card.",
